+/** HST Office: copy and paste formatting with the keys of the reference suite (Ctrl+Shift+C,
+    Ctrl+Shift+V in HST Slides): .uno:HstCopyFormat (SID_HST_COPY_FORMAT) takes the formats of the
+    selected shape, or of the selected text while editing, as the Clone Formatting brush does
+    (SdrObjEditView::TakeFormatPaintBrush), without entering the brush's mouse mode;
+    .uno:HstPasteFormat (SID_HST_PASTE_FORMAT) applies them to every selected shape, or to the selected
